OL,3,GNEWSARailway line on course to reopen
OL,4,Aafter train derailment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA railway line in East Sussex damaged
OL,7,Fafter a train derailment that left 30
OL,8,Fpeople injured is on course to reopen
OL,9,Fnext week, Network Rail has said.
OL,11,FA defect was found on railway tracks
OL,12,Fnear Lewes following the derailment on
OL,13,FAugust 13, a report by the Rail
OL,14,FAccident Investigation Branch (RAIB)
OL,15,Ffound.
OL,17,FEngineers have since removed the
OL,18,Fderailed carriages, rebuilt the
OL,19,Fembankment, installed replacement track
OL,20,Fand repositioned signalling equipment.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
